<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Portal do Professor — Colégio Horizonte</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;700;900&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

:root {
  --verde-escuro: #1a3a2a;
  --verde-medio: #2d6a4f;
  --verde-claro: #52b788;
  --dourado: #c9a84c;
  --dourado-claro: #e8c96e;
  --creme: #faf8f2;
  --cinza-texto: #3d3d3d;
  --branco: #ffffff;
  --sombra: 0 4px 24px rgba(26,58,42,0.12);
}

html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

body {
  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  background: var(--creme);
  color: var(--cinza-texto);
  min-height: 100vh;
}

.barra-topo {
  background: var(--verde-escuro);
  color: var(--creme);
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  padding: 8px 48px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
}

.barra-topo span { opacity: 0.75; }
.barra-topo a { color: var(--dourado-claro); text-decoration: none; }

nav {
  background: var(--branco);
  padding: 0 48px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  height: 76px;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 100;
}

.logo-nav {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 14px;
}

.logo-icone {
  width: 46px;
  height: 46px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--verde-medio), var(--verde-escuro));
  border-radius: 10px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  color: var(--dourado-claro);
  font-size: 1.4rem;
  font-weight: 900;
}

.logo-texto h1 {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  color: var(--verde-escuro);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.1;
}

.logo-texto span {
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  color: var(--verde-claro);
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.nav-links {
  display: flex;
  gap: 36px;
  list-style: none;
}

.nav-links a {
  text-decoration: none;
  color: var(--cinza-texto);
  font-size: 0.88rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  transition: color 0.2s;
  position: relative;
}

.nav-links a::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  bottom: -4px;
  left: 0;
  width: 0;
  height: 2px;
  background: var(--verde-claro);
  transition: width 0.25s;
}

.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--verde-medio); }
.nav-links a:hover::after { width: 100%; }

.btn-acesso {
  background: var(--verde-medio);
  color: var(--branco) !important;
  padding: 9px 22px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  transition: background 0.2s !important;
}

.btn-acesso:hover { background: var(--verde-escuro) !important; }
.btn-acesso::after { display: none !important; }

.hero {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 420px;
  gap: 0;
  min-height: 520px;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.hero-conteudo {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--verde-escuro) 0%, var(--verde-medio) 100%);
  padding: 80px 64px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.hero-conteudo::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: -60px;
  right: -60px;
  width: 300px;
  height: 300px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  border-radius: 50%;
}

.hero-conteudo::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  bottom: -80px;
  left: 40px;
  width: 200px;
  height: 200px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  border-radius: 50%;
}

.badge-boas-vindas {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  background: rgba(201,168,76,0.2);
  border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.4);
  color: var(--dourado-claro);
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 6px 14px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 28px;
  width: fit-content;
}

.badge-boas-vindas span { font-size: 0.9rem; }

.hero-conteudo h2 {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 3rem;
  color: var(--branco);
  line-height: 1.15;
  font-weight: 900;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.hero-conteudo h2 em {
  font-style: normal;
  color: var(--dourado-claro);
}

.hero-conteudo p {
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
  font-size: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
  max-width: 520px;
  margin-bottom: 36px;
}

.hero-stats {
  display: flex;
  gap: 36px;
}

.stat { text-align: left; }

.stat-numero {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 2rem;
  font-weight: 900;
  color: var(--dourado-claro);
  line-height: 1;
}

.stat-label {
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-top: 4px;
}

/* ── LOGIN ── */
.hero-login {
  background: var(--branco);
  padding: 56px 48px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  box-shadow: -8px 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}

.login-saudacao {
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  color: var(--verde-claro);
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-weight: 600;
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}

.hero-login h3 {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 1.6rem;
  color: var(--verde-escuro);
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}

.hero-login > p {
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: #888;
  margin-bottom: 32px;
}

.campo-grupo { margin-bottom: 20px; }

.campo-grupo label {
  display: block;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--verde-escuro);
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.campo-grupo input {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 13px 16px;
  border: 1.5px solid #e0e0e0;
  border-radius: 10px;
  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  font-size: 0.92rem;
  color: var(--cinza-texto);
  background: #fafafa;
  transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  outline: none;
}

.campo-grupo input:focus {
  border-color: var(--verde-claro);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(82,183,136,0.12);
  background: var(--branco);
}

.campo-grupo input::placeholder { color: #c0c0c0; }

.opcoes-login {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.lembrar {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  color: #666;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.lembrar input[type="checkbox"] { accent-color: var(--verde-claro); }

.esqueceu {
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  color: var(--verde-claro);
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.esqueceu:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

.btn-entrar {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 14px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--verde-medio), var(--verde-escuro));
  color: var(--branco);
  border: none;
  border-radius: 10px;
  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: opacity 0.2s, transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.btn-entrar::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0);
  transition: background 0.2s;
}

.btn-entrar:hover { opacity: 0.92; transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(26,58,42,0.25); }
.btn-entrar:active { transform: translateY(0); }

/* Estado de loading no botão */
.btn-entrar.carregando { pointer-events: none; opacity: 0.75; }
.btn-entrar.carregando::before {
  content: '';
  display: inline-block;
  width: 14px;
  height: 14px;
  border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  border-top-color: #fff;
  border-radius: 50%;
  animation: girar 0.6s linear infinite;
  margin-right: 8px;
  vertical-align: middle;
}

@keyframes girar { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }

.divisor-login {
  text-align: center;
  color: #bbb;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  margin: 20px 0;
  position: relative;
}

.divisor-login::before, .divisor-login::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  width: 38%;
  height: 1px;
  background: #e8e8e8;
}

.divisor-login::before { left: 0; }
.divisor-login::after { right: 0; }

.acesso-rapido {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 10px;
}

.btn-acesso-rapido {
  padding: 10px;
  border: 1.5px solid #e0e0e0;
  border-radius: 9px;
  background: var(--branco);
  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  color: #555;
  cursor: pointer;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 6px;
  transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
}

.btn-acesso-rapido:hover { border-color: var(--verde-claro); background: #f0fdf4; transform: translateY(-1px); }

/* Toast de erro */
.toast-erro {
  display: none;
  background: #fff5f5;
  border: 1px solid #fecaca;
  border-left: 4px solid #ef4444;
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 12px 16px;
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  color: #b91c1c;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  animation: surgir 0.25s ease;
}

.toast-erro.visivel { display: block; }

@keyframes surgir {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-6px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

/* ── MÓDULOS ── */
.secao-modulos {
  padding: 80px 48px;
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.titulo-secao {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin-bottom: 48px;
}

.titulo-secao h2 {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 2rem;
  color: var(--verde-escuro);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.titulo-secao h2 span {
  display: block;
  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--verde-claro);
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}

.ver-todos {
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  color: var(--verde-claro);
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  transition: gap 0.2s;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 4px;
}

.ver-todos:hover { gap: 8px; }

.grid-modulos {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
}

.card-modulo {
  background: var(--branco);
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 28px 24px;
  box-shadow: var(--sombra);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: transform 0.25s, box-shadow 0.25s;
  text-decoration: none;
  color: inherit;
  display: block;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.card-modulo::after {
  content: 'Abrir →';
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 16px;
  right: 20px;
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--verde-claro);
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translateX(-6px);
  transition: opacity 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
}

.card-modulo:hover {
  transform: translateY(-6px);
  box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(26,58,42,0.14);
}

.card-modulo:hover::after { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }

.icone-modulo {
  width: 52px;
  height: 52px;
  border-radius: 14px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
  transition: transform 0.2s;
}

.card-modulo:hover .icone-modulo { transform: scale(1.1) rotate(-3deg); }

.card-modulo h4 {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  color: var(--verde-escuro);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.card-modulo p {
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  color: #888;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.tag-modulo {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 3px 10px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}

/* ── AGENDA ── */
.secao-agenda {
  background: var(--verde-escuro);
  padding: 72px 48px;
}

.agenda-inner {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 64px;
  align-items: center;
}

.agenda-titulo h2 {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 2rem;
  color: var(--branco);
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.agenda-titulo p {
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.lista-eventos { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }

.evento {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--dourado);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 18px 20px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr;
  gap: 16px;
  align-items: center;
  transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  cursor: default;
}

.evento:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); transform: translateX(4px); }

.evento-data {
  text-align: center;
  border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  padding-right: 16px;
}

.evento-dia {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 1.8rem;
  color: var(--dourado-claro);
  font-weight: 900;
  line-height: 1;
}

.evento-mes {
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
}

.evento-info h5 {
  color: var(--branco);
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.evento-info p {
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
}

/* ── AVISOS ── */
.secao-avisos {
  padding: 80px 48px;
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.grid-avisos {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
  gap: 24px;
}

.aviso-principal {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--verde-medio), var(--verde-escuro));
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 36px;
  color: var(--branco);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.aviso-principal::after {
  content: '!';
  position: absolute;
  right: -10px;
  top: -20px;
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 12rem;
  font-weight: 900;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
  line-height: 1;
}

.aviso-badge {
  background: var(--dourado);
  color: var(--verde-escuro);
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 4px 12px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  display: inline-block;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.aviso-principal h3 {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 1.4rem;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.aviso-principal p {
  font-size: 0.88rem;
  opacity: 0.8;
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.btn-aviso {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
  color: var(--branco);
  padding: 10px 22px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
}

.btn-aviso:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); transform: translateY(-1px); }

.lista-avisos-sec { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }

.aviso-item {
  background: var(--branco);
  border: 1px solid #eee;
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 18px 20px;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.2s;
}

.aviso-item:hover {
  border-color: var(--verde-claro);
  transform: translateX(4px);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(26,58,42,0.08);
}

.aviso-item-tipo {
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}

.aviso-item h5 {
  font-size: 0.88rem;
  color: var(--verde-escuro);
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.aviso-item span {
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  color: #aaa;
}

/* ── FOOTER ── */
footer {
  background: var(--verde-escuro);
  padding: 48px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 40px;
}

.footer-marca h3 {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  color: var(--branco);
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.footer-marca p {
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
  line-height: 1.7;
  max-width: 260px;
}

.footer-col h5 {
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--dourado-claro);
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.footer-col ul { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }

.footer-col ul a {
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: color 0.2s, padding-left 0.2s;
  display: inline-block;
}

.footer-col ul a:hover { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); padding-left: 4px; }

.footer-rodape {
  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
  text-align: center;
  padding: 16px 48px;
  font-size: 0.74rem;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
}

/* ── MICRO-ANIMAÇÕES ── */
@keyframes pulsar {
  0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
  50% { transform: scale(1.04); }
}

.tag-modulo { animation: pulsar 3s ease-in-out infinite; }

/* Indicador de digitação no campo */
.campo-grupo input:focus + .hint-campo { display: block; }
.hint-campo {
  display: none;
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  color: var(--verde-claro);
  margin-top: 5px;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="barra-topo">
  <span>📍 Av. Educação, 1500 — Recife, PE</span>
  <span>📞 (81) 3000-4567 &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href="#">secretaria@horizonte.edu.br</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp; Ano Letivo 2026</span>
</div>

<nav>
  <div class="logo-nav">
    <div class="logo-icone">H</div>
    <div class="logo-texto">
      <h1>Colégio Horizonte</h1>
      <span>Portal do Educador</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#">Início</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Diário de Classe</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Planos de Aula</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Comunicados</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Precisa de ajuda?</a></li>
    <li><a href="#" class="btn-acesso">Minha Conta</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-conteudo">
    <div class="badge-boas-vindas"><span>✦</span> Bom dia, professor(a)!</div>
    <h2>Sua sala de aula<br>começa <em>aqui.</em></h2>
    <p>Tudo que você precisa para o seu dia — diários, planos de aula, recados da coordenação — num lugar só, sem complicação.</p>
    <div class="hero-stats">
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-numero">148</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Professores ativos</div>
      </div>
